# ToDo Class Diagram

```mermaid

classDiagram

    
    class ToDoItems {
        +list items
        +makeItem() ToDoItem
        +deleteItem()
    }
    
    class ToDoItem {
        +str name
        +Status status
        +setStatus()
        +getStatus() Status
        +setName()
        +getName() str
    }

    class Status {
        +str name
        +getName() str
        +getName()
    }

    ToDoItems "1" o-- "*" ToDoItem : creates
    ToDoItem "1" *-- "1" Status
```
